<title>UK: LME aluminium climbs to fresh 19-month peak in AM.</title>
<headline>LME aluminium climbs to fresh 19-month peak in AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Hits fresh 19-month high at $1,722. Cash/threes</p>
<p>flares slightly to $2/$5 backwardation.</p>
<p>ZINC - Touch firmer, cash/threes at $85/95 backwardation.</p>
<p>COPPER - Also stronger, touches $2,340.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Steady above $7,400 ahead of news on Falconbridge</p>
<p>labour talks.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Little changed.</p>
</text>
